        "content": "## MedFlow — 2h Reminder\n\n2h urgent reminder template.\n\n**Webhook path:** `medflow/reminder-2h`\n**MedFlow env (outbound from MedFlow):** `N8N_WEBHOOK_REMINDER_2H`\n**Callback:** `POST /api/webhooks/reminders`\n\nEnable live mode only in staging with test numbers.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "2e589903-1c4a-49c1-b765-f6e1ec58b62a",
